00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.200
arthritis is no joke from the pain and

00:00:02.879 --> 00:00:07.879
stiffness in the joints across the body

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.240
to the inflammation that never ceases

00:00:07.879 --> 00:00:12.400
being able to manage it and even improve

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.600
the majority if not all of the symptoms

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:19.039
with one supplement would be pretty

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.720
impressive and aren't we just in luck

00:00:19.039 --> 00:00:24.800
because such a supplement does exist so

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.800
let's discuss the science because

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:29.000
there's been at least 30 studies that

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.640
have looked into this antiarthritis

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.640
effect so so we'll go over it briefly

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:37.000
the mechanisms by which it works and

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:39.239
then go into the clinical data detailing

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.399
all the ways that it improves arthritis

