00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:26.560
the production of synovial fluid a

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:29.040
necessary component to a healthy joint

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:31.440
however if they are overactive they can

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:34.400
also contribute to inflammation and pain

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:37.040
cumin quiets them from an overactive

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:39.040
